#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:5
msgid "Reset conductors"
msgstr "重置导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the possibility to return to the default route of a "
"modified conductor."
msgstr "QElectroTech提供了返回被修改导体的默认路径的可能性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:12
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech reset conductor"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech重置导电器"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows resetting the route of a `conductor`_ from `menu bar`_, "
"`toolbar`_, `workspace`_ or using keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许从 `导体 <conductor_>`_，`菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ "
"或使用键盘快捷键重置一个 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的路由。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:18
msgid "Reset conductor from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏重置导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:20
#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:31
#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:56
msgid "`Select the conductor`_ which route should be reset."
msgstr "`选择应当重设的导线 <Select the conductor_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:21
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Reset conductors** menu item to reset the conductor route."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 重置导线** 菜单项来重置导线路由。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:26
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:29
msgid "Reset conductor from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏重置导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select the icon |conductor2| from `toolbar`_ to reset the conductor route."
msgstr "选择 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中的图标 |conductor2| 来重设导线路由 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:34
msgid "conductor2"
msgstr "导线2"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:38
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:41
msgid "Reset conductor from workspace"
msgstr "从工作空间重置导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:43
msgid "Right click on the conductor which route should be reset."
msgstr "右键单击要重设的导线 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:44
msgid "Select the option **Reset conductors** to reset the conductor route."
msgstr "选择选项 **重置导线** 以重置导线路径。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:49
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech导电选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:52
msgid "Reset conductor using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键重置导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:54
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:57
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + k`` to reset the conductor route."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + k`` 重置导线路线。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_reset.rst:61
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
